#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Am I Kawaii?"
msgstr "나 카와이해?"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:244
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "DON'T LOOK AT MEEEEEEE!"
msgstr "날 보지 마아아아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "GNORT!"
msgstr "그노트!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "nurrrrrp!"
msgstr "누르르르릅!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "INTERFERE WITH THE WITCH'S FUN, GET SHOT BY THE WITCH'S GUN!"
msgstr "마녀의 재미를 방해하면, 마녀의 총에 맞는다!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:248
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "BLAUGH!"
msgstr "블러억!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:249
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "blaugh"
msgstr "블러억"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I owe it all to the skeletons!"
msgstr "이게 다 해골들 덕분이야!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:251
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I hear Toronto has a thriving LARPing scene!"
msgstr "토론토엔 LARP 문화가 활발하다던데!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:252
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Wow! A new place to burn down."
msgstr "와! 새로 불태울 곳이다."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:253
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I'm still stuck in this costume! Help!"
msgstr "아직도 이 코스튬에 갇혀 있어! 도와줘!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:254
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "DON'T HAVE COW MAN"
msgstr "소란 떨지 마, 친구"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "EET PANT!"
msgstr "바지 먹어!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:257
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Mission objective in sight!"
msgstr "임무 목표 확인!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Perfect! I can terrorize way more humans here!"
msgstr "완벽해! 여기선 훨씬 더 많은 인간을 공포에 떨게 할 수 있겠어!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "GOOD WORK, BUB!"
msgstr "잘했다, 친구!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "It's way too cold here for this outfit!"
msgstr "이 옷 입고 있기엔 여기 너무 추워!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:261
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Uuurrrrgh ice everywhere."
msgstr "으르르르 사방이 얼음이야."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:262
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "AMERICA #1! WOO! WOOOOOOOOOO!"
msgstr "미국 1등! 우! 우우우우우우우!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:263
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Another win for 100% American Can-Do-ism!"
msgstr "100% 미국식 할 수 있다 정신의 또 한 번의 승리!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "My log says this is a good place to stay."
msgstr "내 항해 일지에 따르면 여긴 머물기 좋은 곳이다."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Yarrrr!"
msgstr "야르르르!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:266
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Good Grief! TRANSLATOR'S NOTE: THIS LOOSELY MEANS 'YARE YARE DAZE'"
msgstr "이런 이런! 역자 주: 대충 '야레야레다제'라는 뜻이다"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I have a confession to make... I was actually a broom the entire time."
msgstr "고백할 게 있어... 난 사실 처음부터 빗자루였어."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I-GER UPPERCUT!"
msgstr "아이-거 어퍼컷!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:269
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "HADOOK! KADOOSHIN'!"
msgstr "하두크! 카두신!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:270
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Heh... all thanks to Sweet Lady Propane."
msgstr "헤... 다 사랑스러운 프로판 아가씨 덕분이지."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:271
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I am victorious! Me! E*FUDD!"
msgstr "내가 이겼다! 나! E*FUDD!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:272
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"Now that I'm here, it's time to check up on my friends... and some women."
msgstr "이제 여기 왔으니 친구들 안부를 확인할 시간이군... 그리고 여자들도."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "It's so exciting to be in the unknown!"
msgstr "미지의 세계에 오다니 정말 신나!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Woah. Canada. Cool, I guess."
msgstr "우와. 캐나다. 멋지네, 아마도."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "IT'S HIGH NOoooo...nevermind. It's just after 4pm. Nice!"
msgstr "하이 누우우우... 아니다. 오후 4시 조금 넘었네. 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Right on cue. It's okay, you can kill me now."
msgstr "딱 맞춰 왔군. 괜찮아, 이제 날 죽여도 돼."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:279
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "RELOADING, BOYS!"
msgstr "재장전한다, 얘들아!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:281
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Hmm. I wonder if I can publish my PhD papers here..."
msgstr "흠. 여기서 내 박사 논문을 출판할 수 있을까..."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:282
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"THE HEAT DEATH OF THE UNIVERSE TRAILS OUR EVERY ACTION AND THOUGHT. HOORAY!"
msgstr "우주의 열적 죽음이 우리의 모든 행동과 생각을 뒤따른다. 만세!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"I PRESENT TO YOU - HALF PRICE TICKETS! PAY LESS, PAY HALF, EVEN! THE WONDERS"
" OF CAPITALISM!!!"
msgstr "여러분께 드립니다 - 반값 티켓! 덜 내세요, 절반만 내세요! 자본주의의 경이로움이여!!!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"Fresh sea, fresh air, the sun beaming down on us...this is what I've always "
"dreamt of."
msgstr "신선한 바다, 신선한 공기, 우리를 비추는 햇살... 이게 내가 늘 꿈꾸던 거야."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:286
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"You all suck at your jobs, you ca- o-oh. Oh. I forgot to cast time stop. "
"Uhmm..."
msgstr "너희 다 일 못하는구나, 이 멍- 어-어. 아. 시간 정지 거는 걸 깜빡했네. 어음..."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:287
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "th-s plac3...it - is...h0me?"
msgstr "이-곳...은...집...?"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "As long as there's zombies, I'll keep on splattering them. Mwah!~"
msgstr "좀비가 있는 한, 계속 터뜨려 줄게. 쪽!~"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:290
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "HAHAHAHA. CANADA IS MINE...BY RIGHT, AS WELL AS BY MIGHT."
msgstr "하하하하. 캐나다는 내 것이다... 권리로도, 힘으로도."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:291
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"Grand-Admiral Merenja Raven, locked, loaded and ready. FULLLLLLLL "
"AHEAAAAAADDDD!"
msgstr "대제독 메렌자 레이븐, 장전 완료, 준비 완료. 전소오오오옥 전지이이이인!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:292
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Such talent! Such sorceries! Such a pleasure!"
msgstr "이런 재능! 이런 마법! 이런 즐거움!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:294
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Aww, thanks for picking me! Let me know that you've made it! ;3"
msgstr "아잉, 골라 줘서 고마워! 도착하면 알려 줘! ;3"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:295
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"AWH MAN, THIS IS JUST LIKE THAT TIME I WENT TO CANADA COZ ZOMBIES WERE "
"EVERYWHERE."
msgstr "아 이거 완전 좀비가 사방에 있어서 캐나다 갔던 그때랑 똑같네."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:296
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "SO IS THIS PLACE A JOKE OR WHAT?"
msgstr "그래서 여기 장난이야 뭐야?"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Aaaand...cut to black."
msgstr "그리고오... 화면 암전."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "TONIGHT...ON BOTTOM GEAR."
msgstr "오늘 밤... 바텀 기어에서."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:300
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "So, I heard you're looking for guards with experience..."
msgstr "그래서, 경험 많은 경비병을 찾는다고 들었는데..."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:301
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"SAY, GOT ANY LEDGES I CAN THROW MYSELF FROM? KINDA NOSTALGIC FOR IT I GUESS."
msgstr "저기, 몸 던질 만한 난간 같은 거 있어? 좀 그리운 것 같아서."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "NEED AN ANCHOR ANYWHERE? HMM? OH, NO REASON WHY..."
msgstr "어디 닻 필요한 데 없어? 응? 아, 그냥 물어본 거야..."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:303
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Hmm...looks like Canada needs a construction company or two."
msgstr "흠... 캐나다엔 건설 회사가 한두 개쯤 필요해 보이는군."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"AUGH THEY'RE GONNA HAV' TO GLUE YOU BACK TOGETHER...in the nearest hospital."
msgstr "으아 너 접착제로 다시 붙여야겠다... 가까운 병원에서."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:307
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "The reward of Honour...is making it to Canada."
msgstr "명예의 보상은... 캐나다에 도착하는 것이다."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:308
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"Ever considered installing cannons at the walls? I have one in my bathroom."
msgstr "성벽에 대포를 설치할 생각은 해 봤나? 난 욕실에도 하나 있다."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:309
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "is momentarily possessed by some kind of omnipotent force.*"
msgstr "은(는) 잠시 어떤 전능한 힘에 사로잡힌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:310
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Remember: tuck, duck, buck, wash your hands and roll."
msgstr "기억해: 숙이고, 피하고, 버티고, 손 씻고, 굴러."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:312
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "bork."
msgstr "멍."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:313
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "MEOW!"
msgstr "야옹!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:314
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "BAAAAA!"
msgstr "메에에에!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:315
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "OINK!"
msgstr "꿀꿀!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:316
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "HRONK!"
msgstr "꽥!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:318
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "CAAARRRL!"
msgstr "칼아아아알!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:319
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Oh hey, I made it. Thanks fer playing Death Road to Canada!"
msgstr "아 안녕, 나 도착했어. 데스 로드 투 캐나다를 플레이해 줘서 고마워!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:321
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Way past cool!"
msgstr "쿨함 그 이상!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:323
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I love you, Canada-chan."
msgstr "사랑해, 캐나다쨩."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:324
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "The Phoenix rises! ==flaps arms like they are wings=="
msgstr "불사조가 날아오른다! ==날개처럼 팔을 퍼덕인다=="

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:325
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Am I finally too swole?"
msgstr "나 드디어 너무 우람해진 건가?"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:327
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Delicious!"
msgstr "맛있다!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:330
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "BERSERKED!"
msgstr "광폭화!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:338
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr "예!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:341
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Feh."
msgstr "흥."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:347
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Whew."
msgstr "휴."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:350
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Argh!"
msgstr "으악!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:356
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I knew it!"
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:359
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Uh, what?"
msgstr "어, 뭐?"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:366
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became a stand up citizen of Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다의 모범 시민이 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:369
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued being an enormous jerk.*"
msgstr "은(는) 계속 엄청난 얼간이로 살았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:373
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Hooray!"
msgstr "만세!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:382
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "got kicked out of Canada after refusing to give up guns.*"
msgstr "은(는) 총을 포기하길 거부하다가 캐나다에서 쫓겨났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:383
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"channeled EHIS gun obsession into a productive hobby: pine cone collecting.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 총 집착을 생산적인 취미로 돌렸다: 솔방울 모으기.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:384
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became a famous trick-shooting attraction at the Canadian Circus.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다 서커스의 유명한 묘기 사격 볼거리가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:385
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"accidentally shot EHIS own foot off, within 5 minutes of entering Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에 들어온 지 5분 만에 실수로 EHIS 발을 쏴 날렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:386
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "shot a penguin by accident, violating the Canadian Prime Directive.*"
msgstr "은(는) 실수로 펭귄을 쏴서 캐나다 최우선 지령을 위반했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:391
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"gets arrested after finding EHIS medical practice is not licensed in "
"Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 의료 행위가 캐나다에서 무면허라는 게 드러나 체포되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:392
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "diagnoses every single one of EHIS patients with a farting problem.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 환자 한 명도 빠짐없이 방귀 질환 진단을 내렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:393
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"tries to cure the zombie infection, but just makes their hair a little "
"nicer.*"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 감염을 치료하려 했지만, 환자들 머릿결만 살짝 좋아졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:394
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "develops a cure for flatulence, which is then named after EHIM .*"
msgstr "은(는) 방귀 치료제를 개발했고, 그 약에는 EHIM의 이름이 붙었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:395
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"does a mad doctor head transplant with a moose. This becomes very popular!*"
msgstr "은(는) 무스와 머리 이식 수술을 하는 미친 의사가 되었다. 이게 대유행했다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:400
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"makes incredible innovations to the Mecha Mounties. They now serve coffee.*"
msgstr "은(는) 메카 기마경찰을 엄청나게 혁신했다. 이제 커피도 내준다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:401
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "designs a very popular line of goofy three wheeled cars.*"
msgstr "은(는) 웃기게 생긴 바퀴 셋 달린 차 시리즈를 디자인해 큰 인기를 끌었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:402
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "is recognized as a hero after inventing a more overpowered chainsaw.*"
msgstr "은(는) 더 사기적인 전기톱을 발명해 영웅으로 인정받았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:403
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"invents a new version of the chainsaw, one with colorful lights attached to "
"it.*"
msgstr "은(는) 알록달록한 조명이 달린 새 전기톱을 발명했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:404
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "becomes rich after inventing a car engine that runs off poutine.*"
msgstr "은(는) 푸틴으로 굴러가는 자동차 엔진을 발명해 부자가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:405
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"invents a better mousetrap. It has carbon fiber on it and a USB drive.*"
msgstr "은(는) 더 좋은 쥐덫을 발명했다. 탄소 섬유에 USB 드라이브까지 달렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:410
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"came up with a wildly popular fitness program based on EHIS zombie survival "
"experience.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 좀비 생존 경험을 바탕으로 한 피트니스 프로그램을 만들어 대박을 쳤다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:411
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"became an athlete in the post-zombocalypse Olympics, where Canada won every "
"medal!*"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 사태 이후 올림픽에 선수로 나갔고, 캐나다가 메달을 전부 땄다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:412
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"lived a long, healthy life in Canada. At the age of 100, was bit by a moose "
"and exploded.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 길고 건강한 삶을 살았다. 100살에 무스에게 물려 폭발했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:413
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"took up hockey, excelling at it after all that practice knocking zombie "
"teeth around.*"
msgstr "은(는) 하키를 시작했고, 좀비 이빨을 날려 대던 연습 덕분에 두각을 나타냈다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:414
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"invented a new zombie-specific martial art, then taught it to many "
"disciples.*"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 전용 무술을 새로 창시해 많은 제자에게 가르쳤다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:419
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"devoted EHIS entire life to helping restore bodybuilding to its former "
"glory.*"
msgstr "은(는) 보디빌딩의 옛 영광을 되찾는 데 EHIS 평생을 바쳤다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:421
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"started flexing continuously after crossing the border, and never stopped. "
"No one minded.*"
msgstr "은(는) 국경을 넘은 뒤로 쉬지 않고 근육에 힘을 줬고, 멈추지 않았다. 아무도 상관 안 했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:422
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"became a legendary folk hero after suplexing a moose that EHE was arguing "
"with.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHE가 말다툼하던 무스를 수플렉스로 꽂아 전설적인 민중 영웅이 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:423
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"would often return to the border, just to throw heavy furniture at more "
"zombies.*"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비에게 무거운 가구를 던지러 종종 국경으로 돌아가곤 했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:424
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"later was elected President of All Lumberjacks due to EHIS mighty strength.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 막강한 힘 덕분에 나중에 전 나무꾼 연합 회장으로 선출되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:429
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"continued running down this road, until EHE disappeared past the horizon.*"
msgstr "은(는) 이 길을 계속 달려, 결국 EHE는 지평선 너머로 사라졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:430
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was widely known for EHIS running speed, earning the nickname 'Sonic the "
"Hedgehog'.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 달리기 속도로 널리 알려져 '고슴도치 소닉'이라는 별명을 얻었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:431
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "used EHIS super fast legs to become a famous dancer.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 엄청 빠른 다리로 유명한 댄서가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:432
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"helped provide power to new frontier cities after being put in a big hamster"
" wheel.*"
msgstr "은(는) 거대한 햄스터 쳇바퀴에 들어가 새 개척 도시에 전기를 공급했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:437
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"wanted to become a moose. After getting good grades in moose school EHE made"
" this come true.*"
msgstr "은(는) 무스가 되고 싶었다. 무스 학교에서 좋은 성적을 받은 끝에 EHE는 꿈을 이뤘다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:438
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"became a bat-themed masked vigilante. Copyright lawyers were called in.*"
msgstr "은(는) 박쥐 콘셉트의 복면 자경단원이 되었다. 저작권 변호사들이 불려 왔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:439
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"settled into a quiet life. It was kind of boring, without the zombies.*"
msgstr "은(는) 조용한 삶에 정착했다. 좀비가 없으니 좀 지루했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:440
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"roamed the northern frontiers, having more adventures but with less "
"zombies.*"
msgstr "은(는) 북쪽 변방을 떠돌며 더 많은 모험을 했다. 좀비는 더 적었지만.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:441
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"wrote a popular zombie survival guide that was just full of bad advice.*"
msgstr "은(는) 나쁜 조언만 가득한 좀비 생존 가이드를 써서 베스트셀러가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:442
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"had difficulty adjusting to Canada, and eventually went back south for more "
"adventure.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에 적응하지 못하고, 결국 더 많은 모험을 찾아 다시 남쪽으로 갔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:443
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was eventually banned from driving cars after destroying one every week.*"
msgstr "은(는) 매주 차를 한 대씩 부숴서 결국 운전 금지를 당했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:444
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "tried to become a Mountie, but didn't really have the skills for it.*"
msgstr "은(는) 기마경찰이 되려 했지만, 실력이 영 모자랐다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:445
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"never got used to the food, too used to the junk food EHE scavenged on the "
"Death Road.*"
msgstr "은(는) 음식에 끝내 적응하지 못했다. EHE가 데스 로드에서 주워 먹던 정크 푸드에 너무 익숙해서였다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:446
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"didn't have any strong skills, and EHE had a peaceful but uneventful life in"
" Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 딱히 뛰어난 기술이 없었고, EHE는 캐나다에서 평화롭지만 밋밋한 삶을 살았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:451
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "later would take over parts of Canada with an army of trained dogs.*"
msgstr "은(는) 나중에 훈련된 개 군단으로 캐나다 일부를 장악했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:452
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "had a long life with a lot of pet dogs.*"
msgstr "은(는) 개를 잔뜩 키우며 오래 살았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:453
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"patrolled the border with EHIS ever-growing pack of zombie-hunting dogs.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 계속 불어나는 좀비 사냥개 무리와 함께 국경을 순찰했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:454
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"spent EHIS life trying to get one of EHIS dogs elected as Prime Minister.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 개 한 마리를 총리로 당선시키려고 EHIS 평생을 바쳤다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:459
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"made an anime based on EHIS adventures. It took some creative liberties in "
"regards to cuteness.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 모험을 바탕으로 애니를 만들었다. 귀여움 쪽으로 각색이 좀 들어갔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:460
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "devoted the rest of EHIS life to the anime that saved EHIM .*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 남은 인생을 EHIM 자신을 구해 준 애니에 바쳤다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:461
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "outgrew childish anime, and switched to manga.*"
msgstr "은(는) 유치한 애니를 졸업하고 만화로 갈아탔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:462
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"wrote a manga that portrayed zombies as anime girls. The fans grew into a "
"bizarre cult.*"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비를 미소녀로 그린 만화를 그렸다. 팬들은 기괴한 컬트 집단이 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:467
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "spontaneously combusted. Exactly how EHE wanted to go!*"
msgstr "은(는) 갑자기 저절로 불타 버렸다. EHE가 원하던 바로 그 방식으로!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:468
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was bit by a beaver on the foot. Both exploded into chunks.*"
msgstr "은(는) 비버에게 발을 물렸다. 둘 다 산산조각으로 폭발했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:469
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was obliterated when hit by a snowball. One health.*"
msgstr "은(는) 눈뭉치에 맞아 소멸했다. 체력 1이었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:470
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was exiled after destroying a town in a friendly hockey game.*"
msgstr "은(는) 친선 하키 경기 중에 마을 하나를 박살 내서 추방당했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:475
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"became the most 'kawaii' anime girl in Canada. Translator's Note: Kawaii "
"means cute.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 가장 '카와이'한 애니 소녀가 되었다. 역자 주: 카와이는 귀엽다는 뜻이다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:476
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued fighting evil by blasting things with giant heart beams.*"
msgstr "은(는) 거대한 하트 빔으로 이것저것 날려 버리며 계속 악과 싸웠다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:477
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"soon reached Super Saiyan form, which mostly gave her a bigger hair-do.*"
msgstr "은(는) 곧 초사이어인 형태에 도달했다. 주로 머리 모양만 커졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:478
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "FINALLY confessed to sempai.*"
msgstr "은(는) 드디어 선배에게 고백했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:483
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"integrated into Canadian society well, despite being a walking skeleton.*"
msgstr "은(는) 걸어 다니는 해골인데도 캐나다 사회에 잘 녹아들었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:484
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "kept getting run out of town due to dancing in a spooky fashion.*"
msgstr "은(는) 으스스하게 춤을 춰서 자꾸 마을에서 쫓겨났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:485
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"lived a normal and happy life, but with a lot of unnecessary clacking "
"noises.*"
msgstr "은(는) 평범하고 행복하게 살았다. 쓸데없이 딸깍거리는 소리가 많긴 했지만.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:486
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "never, ever figured out exactly why or how EHE needed to eat food.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHE가 왜, 어떻게 음식을 먹어야 했는지 끝내 알아내지 못했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:491
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became an expert chef, in huge demand for EHIS 'canned food cuisine'.*"
msgstr "은(는) 전문 요리사가 되었다. EHIS '통조림 요리'를 찾는 사람이 줄을 섰다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:492
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "got a job as a food critic, which is maybe the best job there is.*"
msgstr "은(는) 음식 평론가가 되었다. 아마 세상에서 제일 좋은 직업일 거다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:493
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "finally got to eat something that wasn't old junk food or canned.*"
msgstr "은(는) 드디어 낡은 정크 푸드나 통조림이 아닌 음식을 먹었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:494
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"went on a new journey to sample all the fine cuisine that Canada has to "
"offer.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다의 온갖 훌륭한 요리를 맛보는 새 여정을 떠났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:499
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was reponsible for a string of robberies in Canada, before getting exiled.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 연쇄 강도 사건을 저지르다가 추방되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:500
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"established a feared crime syndicate. One where everyone wore fancy "
"dresses.*"
msgstr "은(는) 공포의 범죄 조직을 세웠다. 다들 화려한 드레스를 입는 조직이다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:501
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"suppressed EHIS urge to rob people in Canada. Instead, EHE was just an "
"enormous jerk.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 사람을 털고 싶은 EHIS 충동을 억눌렀다. 대신, EHE는 그냥 엄청난 얼간이였다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:502
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "lead a heist to steal the Prime Minister's Royal Jewels.*"
msgstr "은(는) 총리의 왕실 보석을 훔치는 강도단을 이끌었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:507
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "mostly gnawed on whatever EHE could get EHIS mouth on, really.*"
msgstr "은(는) 그냥 EHE가 EHIS 입에 넣을 수 있는 건 대부분 다 씹어 댔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:508
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "marked as much territory as possible.*"
msgstr "은(는) 영역 표시를 최대한 많이 했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:509
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
", being too used to the freedom of the open road, never became housebroken.*"
msgstr "은(는) 탁 트인 길의 자유에 너무 익숙해서, 끝내 배변 훈련이 안 됐다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:510
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"spent the rest of EHIS life barking incessantly at all the new wildlife.*"
msgstr "은(는) EHIS 남은 평생 새로운 야생 동물들을 보고 쉴 새 없이 짖었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:511
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"found a good home and happily did dog stuff for the rest of EHIS life.*"
msgstr "은(는) 좋은 집을 찾아 EHIS 남은 평생 행복하게 개다운 일을 했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:535
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "made a ton of friends and opened up a summer camp!*"
msgstr "은(는) 친구를 잔뜩 사귀고 여름 캠프를 열었다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:536
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became a hermit in Canada. Instead of being a hermit in America.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 은둔자가 되었다. 미국에서 은둔자로 사는 대신.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:537
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was able to spread Christmas Cheer to all of Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다 전역에 크리스마스의 기쁨을 퍼뜨렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:538
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"dumped enormous piles of coal out of his sleigh, onto everyone's houses.*"
msgstr "은(는) 썰매에서 어마어마한 석탄 더미를 모든 집 위에 쏟아부었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:539
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued flailing around.*"
msgstr "은(는) 계속 허우적거렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:540
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"reached the highest ranks in the beloved Canadian sport of Sumo Wrestling.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다인들이 사랑하는 스포츠, 스모에서 최고 등급에 올랐다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:541
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"returned back to Valhalla, but not before throwing her hammer at a lot of "
"important monuments.*"
msgstr "은(는) 발할라로 돌아갔다. 가기 전에 중요한 기념물 여러 개에 망치를 던지고 갔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:542
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was reunited with his wrestling rivals, and had many exciting battles.*"
msgstr "은(는) 레슬링 라이벌들과 재회해 신나는 대결을 잔뜩 벌였다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:543
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"ran around punching things and muttering. People, animals, statues, you name"
" it.*"
msgstr "은(는) 중얼거리며 아무거나 주먹으로 치고 다녔다. 사람, 동물, 동상, 가리지 않았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:544
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"set up a very nice secret lab in Canada, then made an army of mutant "
"beavers.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에 아주 근사한 비밀 연구소를 차리고 돌연변이 비버 군단을 만들었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:545
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "made most of the Canadian wildlife extinct, due to her army of cats.*"
msgstr "은(는) 고양이 군단 때문에 캐나다 야생 동물 대부분을 멸종시켰다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:546
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"finally found a civilized place to stay. She developed a popular fashion "
"line.*"
msgstr "은(는) 드디어 머물 만한 문명적인 곳을 찾았다. 그녀가 만든 패션 브랜드는 인기를 끌었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:547
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"pestered the group forever, making everyone regret that wish for "
"friendship.*"
msgstr "은(는) 일행을 영원히 귀찮게 해서, 다들 우정을 바랐던 걸 후회하게 만들었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:548
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "founded the Mountie Rollerskating Division, feared by all evil-doers.*"
msgstr "은(는) 모든 악당이 두려워하는 기마경찰 롤러스케이트 부대를 창설했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:549
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"started a new journey to make it to Colombia. After that, other C "
"countries.*"
msgstr "은(는) 콜롬비아까지 가는 새 여정을 시작했다. 그다음엔 C로 시작하는 다른 나라들.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:550
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was finally able to retire the bee suit, replacing it with a moose theme.*"
msgstr "은(는) 드디어 벌 옷을 벗고 무스 콘셉트로 갈아탔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:551
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "swiftly got kicked out of the country for being an immense jerk.*"
msgstr "은(는) 엄청난 얼간이라는 이유로 순식간에 나라에서 쫓겨났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:552
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"rose high in life. No one ever figured out he was three dogs stacked on each"
" other.*"
msgstr "은(는) 출세했다. 그가 개 세 마리가 겹쳐 서 있는 거라는 건 아무도 눈치채지 못했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:553
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"attracted many bodybuilder disciples. He was no longer The Last "
"Bodybuilder.*"
msgstr "은(는) 보디빌더 제자를 잔뜩 모았다. 그는 더 이상 마지막 보디빌더가 아니었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:554
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became famous for his very popular and insightful stand-up comedy.*"
msgstr "은(는) 통찰력 넘치는 스탠드업 코미디로 큰 인기를 끌며 유명해졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:555
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "survived against all odds. Happy Thanksgiving!*"
msgstr "은(는) 온갖 역경을 딛고 살아남았다. 해피 추수감사절!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:556
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "inflicted all sorts of clown-related horrors on Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에 온갖 광대 관련 공포를 퍼뜨렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:557
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "wandered Canada searching for worthy fencing opponents.*"
msgstr "은(는) 실력 있는 펜싱 상대를 찾아 캐나다를 떠돌았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:558
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued to hate Mondays.*"
msgstr "은(는) 계속 월요일을 싫어했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:559
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"wished everyone goodbye. With tears in his eyes, he turned into a tree.*"
msgstr "은(는) 모두에게 작별 인사를 했다. 그리고 눈물을 글썽이며 나무로 변했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:560
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"gathered a large following of people, all running around in identical "
"masks.*"
msgstr "은(는) 똑같은 가면을 쓰고 뛰어다니는 추종자들을 잔뜩 거느렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:561
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was put in a zoo after everyone realized she was a real panda.*"
msgstr "은(는) 진짜 판다라는 게 밝혀져 동물원에 들어갔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:562
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"became a famous singer, with his hit song: 'Death Road to Canada (Baby, "
"Baby)'.*"
msgstr "은(는) 유명 가수가 되었다. 히트곡: '데스 로드 투 캐나다 (베이비, 베이비)'.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:563
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"got rich by selling a new type of mop that won't break when smashing "
"zombies.*"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비를 때려도 안 부러지는 신형 대걸레를 팔아 부자가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:564
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"managed to keep his minigun in Canada. No one really wanted to take it away "
"from him.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서도 미니건을 지켜 냈다. 아무도 그에게서 그걸 뺏고 싶어 하지 않았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:565
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"went back to being a scientist. This mostly involves hitting stuff with a "
"crowbar.*"
msgstr "은(는) 다시 과학자로 돌아갔다. 대부분 쇠지렛대로 뭔가를 때리는 일이다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:566
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "released Half-Life 3.*"
msgstr "은(는) 하프라이프 3를 출시했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:567
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "blundered around for the rest of his life, smashing pottery.*"
msgstr "은(는) 남은 평생 허둥지둥 돌아다니며 도자기를 깨부쉈다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:568
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "finally found a bathroom he could safely poop in.*"
msgstr "은(는) 드디어 안전하게 똥 쌀 수 있는 화장실을 찾았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:569
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"predicted that he'd safely make it to Canada, and look where he is now.*"
msgstr "은(는) 자기가 캐나다에 무사히 도착할 거라고 예측했다. 그리고 지금 그가 어디 있는지 봐라.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:570
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became True Anime!*"
msgstr "은(는) 진정한 애니가 되었다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:571
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"lurked in the countryside as an abomination, sometimes scaring villagers. "
"Nice!*"
msgstr "은(는) 시골에 숨어 사는 괴물이 되어 가끔 마을 사람들을 놀라게 했다. 좋아!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:572
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "is some kind of gerbil or something? I don't know.*"
msgstr "은(는) 저빌 같은 건가? 모르겠다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:573
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "returned to its family in Canada, after a long time away.*"
msgstr "은(는) 오랜 시간 끝에 캐나다에 있는 가족에게 돌아갔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:574
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "I love skeletoning!"
msgstr "해골 짓 너무 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:575
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "built a really cool gingerbread house.*"
msgstr "은(는) 정말 멋진 진저브레드 하우스를 지었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:576
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued to spend his un-life going BLUGH and turning into a bat.*"
msgstr "은(는) 블러억 하고 외치며 박쥐로 변하는 언데드 생활을 계속했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:577
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "got stuck in bat-form, somehow.*"
msgstr "은(는) 어째선지 박쥐 모습으로 굳어 버렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:578
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"grew an enormous skeleton army. They never did much, she just liked to "
"collect them.*"
msgstr "은(는) 거대한 해골 군단을 키웠다. 딱히 하는 일은 없었고, 그녀는 그냥 모으는 게 좋았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:579
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became a popular bard in the Royal Court of the King of Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다 국왕의 궁정에서 인기 음유시인이 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:580
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"left Canada after finding out everything was harder to burn due to the ice.*"
msgstr "은(는) 얼음 때문에 뭐든 불태우기가 더 어렵다는 걸 알고 캐나다를 떠났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:581
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "destroyed Toronto. Not the real city, just a small cardboard replica.*"
msgstr "은(는) 토론토를 파괴했다. 진짜 도시 말고, 작은 골판지 모형을.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:582
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "vanished back into the Bort Dimension, from whence he was summoned.*"
msgstr "은(는) 자신이 소환됐던 보트 차원으로 사라졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:583
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"had a boss fight with Ascendant Bizarro-Krankor. They talked their issues "
"out.*"
msgstr "은(는) 초월한 비자로-크랭코어와 보스전을 벌였다. 둘은 대화로 문제를 풀었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:584
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued to inspire people due to his perfect resemblance to Bart.*"
msgstr "은(는) 바트와 꼭 닮은 모습으로 사람들에게 계속 영감을 주었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:585
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"went on to complete his secret mission: stealing the Tim Hortons coffee "
"recipe.*"
msgstr "은(는) 비밀 임무를 완수했다: 팀 홀튼 커피 레시피 훔치기.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:586
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"dug out a sweet monster-filled dungeon. It had orcs and goblins and traps. "
"Nice!*"
msgstr "은(는) 괴물이 가득한 근사한 던전을 팠다. 오크도 고블린도 함정도 있었다. 좋아!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:587
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was mistaken for a rare subspecies of wolverine and got thrown into a zoo. "
"He didn't mind.*"
msgstr "은(는) 희귀한 울버린 아종으로 오인받아 동물원에 갇혔다. 그는 신경 쓰지 않았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:588
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"changed his cosplay to a character that wore thick winter clothes instead of"
" tights.*"
msgstr "은(는) 코스프레를 쫄쫄이 대신 두꺼운 겨울옷을 입는 캐릭터로 바꿨다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:589
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"took a nap that day and was immediately encased in ice. She woke up in the "
"far far future.*"
msgstr "은(는) 그날 낮잠을 잤다가 곧바로 얼음 속에 갇혔다. 그녀는 아주 먼 미래에 깨어났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:590
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "quietly and sheepishly applied for Canadian citizenship.*"
msgstr "은(는) 조용히, 머쓱하게 캐나다 시민권을 신청했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:591
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"helped the mounties develop powerful log-based anti-zombie technology.*"
msgstr "은(는) 기마경찰이 강력한 통나무 기반 대좀비 기술을 개발하는 걸 도왔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:592
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "built a pirate ship and became the terror of Lake Ontario.*"
msgstr "은(는) 해적선을 만들어 온타리오 호수의 공포가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:593
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "finally, FINALLY gets to kick a football.*"
msgstr "은(는) 드디어, 드디어 축구공을 찬다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:594
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "gets stuck in a broom closet, but in Canada this time.*"
msgstr "은(는) 빗자루 벽장에 갇힌다. 이번엔 캐나다에서.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:595
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"quits his job as a tournament fighter and starts selling a popular designer "
"eyepatches.*"
msgstr "은(는) 격투 대회 선수를 그만두고 인기 디자이너 안대를 팔기 시작한다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:596
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"starts a fighting tournament in Canada, where he mostly shoots fireballs at "
"moose (meese?).*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 격투 대회를 연다. 주로 무스(무스들?)에게 파이어볼을 쏜다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:597
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"opens up a propane business in Canada. The twist: He also sells propane "
"accessories.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 프로판 사업을 시작한다. 반전: 프로판 액세서리도 판다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:598
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"forms a basketball team, just in case aliens challenge the earth to a game "
"of hoops.*"
msgstr "은(는) 외계인이 지구에 농구 시합을 걸어올 경우에 대비해 농구팀을 만든다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:599
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was later arrested for harassment after being unable to acclimate to the "
"status quo.*"
msgstr "은(는) 새로운 현실에 적응하지 못하고 결국 괴롭힘 혐의로 체포되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:600
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"mapped out the entirety of Canada, exploring every last nook and cranny.*"
msgstr "은(는) 구석구석 탐험하며 캐나다 전체 지도를 완성했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:601
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "mostly did nothing, because he's just some guy. Really.*"
msgstr "은(는) 거의 아무것도 안 했다. 그냥 평범한 녀석이니까. 진짜로.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "found a new home in the local Pukeymon shelter.*"
msgstr "은(는) 동네 푸키몬 보호소에서 새 보금자리를 찾았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:604
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was sued for damages after bursting into too many saloons.*"
msgstr "은(는) 술집에 너무 자주 쳐들어가서 손해 배상 소송을 당했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:605
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was executed by Otherwordly Divine Power for that awful joke.*"
msgstr "은(는) 그 끔찍한 농담 때문에 이계의 신성한 힘에 처형당했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:606
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "died after being jumpscared by a moose while shaving.*"
msgstr "은(는) 면도하다가 무스에게 깜짝 놀라 죽었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:608
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"covered herself in purple goo. As any physicist may know, this allowed her "
"to fly.*"
msgstr "은(는) 보라색 끈적이를 온몸에 발랐다. 물리학자라면 알겠지만, 덕분에 그녀는 날 수 있었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:609
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"gets banned from Montreal after running around it to smash up power boxes.*"
msgstr "은(는) 배전함을 부수러 돌아다니다가 몬트리올 출입 금지를 당한다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was Canada's 19th top showman, on a list of 18 written by himself. He CAN be"
" humble!*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다 최고의 쇼맨 19위였다. 본인이 직접 쓴 18명짜리 명단에서. 그도 겸손할 줄 안다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:612
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was herself smitten by a talking tree. Thus, the grand and beautiful cycle "
"continues.*"
msgstr "은(는) 그녀 자신이 말하는 나무에게 반해 버렸다. 이렇게 위대하고 아름다운 순환은 계속된다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:613
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"set his clock too far forward, causing him to wake up 100 years in the "
"future.*"
msgstr "은(는) 시계를 너무 앞으로 돌려서 100년 뒤 미래에 깨어났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:614
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "vanished into thin air, as if they'd never existed at all.*"
msgstr "은(는) 처음부터 존재하지 않았던 것처럼 허공으로 사라졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:616
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"flew to the moon and played amongst the stars, or something. Idk, I've never"
" been there.*"
msgstr "은(는) 달로 날아가 별들 사이에서 놀았다, 뭐 그런 거. 몰라, 거기 가 본 적 없어.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:617
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"accidentally whispered an incantation that wrecked Canada with storms for "
"1000s of years.*"
msgstr "은(는) 실수로 주문을 속삭이는 바람에 캐나다를 수천 년 동안 폭풍으로 망가뜨렸다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:618
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"spent most of her life attempting to de-thaw Canada's rivers with a "
"hairdryer...with mild success.*"
msgstr "은(는) 평생 헤어드라이어로 캐나다의 강을 녹이려 애썼다... 성과는 그럭저럭.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:619
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"spent his life as a librarian, using telekenesis to pioneer the automatic "
"sorting of books.*"
msgstr "은(는) 사서로 일하며 염력으로 자동 도서 분류의 선구자가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:621
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"planted herself in the ground somewhere dark and quiet, and was basically "
"never seen again.*"
msgstr "은(는) 어둡고 조용한 어딘가의 땅에 자신을 심었고, 다시는 거의 눈에 띄지 않았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:622
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "inspired other people with his values: a real Family Guy.*"
msgstr "은(는) 자신의 가치관으로 사람들에게 영감을 주었다: 진정한 패밀리 가이.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:623
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"exploded after going 20 dollars into credit card debt. Another Canadian "
"tragedy...*"
msgstr "은(는) 신용카드 빚이 20달러 생기자 폭발했다. 또 하나의 캐나다 비극...*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:625
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"was ambushed by a group of snowmen. They were made, he didn't stand a "
"chance.*"
msgstr "은(는) 눈사람 무리에게 기습당했다. 놈들은 조직원이었다. 그는 상대가 안 됐다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:626
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"became the star of the show 'Bottom Gear', a wholesome family show about car"
" fumes.*"
msgstr "은(는) 자동차 배기가스를 다루는 건전한 가족 프로그램 '바텀 기어'의 스타가 되었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:627
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"started a hot chocolate company, which was actually just a front for tax "
"fraud.*"
msgstr "은(는) 핫초코 회사를 차렸다. 사실은 탈세용 위장 회사였다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:628
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"missed crashing cars, so started jumping into ANY window they could see. The"
" police were called.*"
msgstr "은(는) 차 충돌이 그리워서 보이는 창문마다 뛰어들었다. 경찰이 출동했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:629
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"challenged the prime minister for his title in a fighting match. They both "
"lost - to a freakish gerbil.*"
msgstr "은(는) 총리에게 칭호를 걸고 결투를 신청했다. 둘 다 졌다 - 기괴한 저빌에게.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:630
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "spent his life fortifying Canada's walls, to great effect.*"
msgstr "은(는) 평생 캐나다의 성벽을 보강했고, 효과는 대단했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "spontaneously exploded. Some things we will never understand.*"
msgstr "은(는) 갑자기 저절로 폭발했다. 세상엔 영영 이해 못 할 일도 있다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "perished, as many Shogun do, in a freak poetry accident.*"
msgstr "은(는) 많은 쇼군이 그렇듯, 기괴한 시 낭송 사고로 세상을 떠났다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:634
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"created the play 'Pirates of Perchance', a touching story about an "
"illiterate swashbuckler.*"
msgstr "은(는) 글 모르는 검객의 감동적인 이야기, 연극 '퍼챈스의 해적'을 만들었다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"Congrats! You found the secret ending dialogue! You must have waited FOREVER"
" for that..."
msgstr "축하해! 비밀 엔딩 대사를 찾았구나! 이거 보려고 엄청 기다렸겠는데..."

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:636
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid ""
"became a part-time firefighter, part-time arsonist. Work in post-Canada is "
"scarce!*"
msgstr "은(는) 시간제 소방관이자 시간제 방화범이 되었다. 캐나다 이후엔 일자리가 귀하다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:638
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "lived that dog life.*"
msgstr "은(는) 개답게 살았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:639
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "started a campaign of mass murder on the local wildlife, as cats do.*"
msgstr "은(는) 고양이들이 그렇듯, 동네 야생 동물을 상대로 대학살을 벌였다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:640
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became a Canadian goat. Which is just like a non-Canadian goat.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다 염소가 되었다. 캐나다 염소가 아닌 염소랑 똑같다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:641
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was widely recognized in Canada as being SOME PIG!*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 '대단한 돼지'로 널리 인정받았다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:642
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "was finally a free animal again, and vanished into the wilderness.*"
msgstr "은(는) 드디어 다시 자유로운 동물이 되어 야생 속으로 사라졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:644
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "CAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAARRRRRRRRRRRRRL!"
msgstr "칼아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아알!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:645
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "Secret Tip: Look for the Well of Wishes in the Crypt of Decay!"
msgstr "비밀 팁: 부패의 지하실에서 소원의 우물을 찾아봐!"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:647
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "went fast.*"
msgstr "은(는) 빨리 갔다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:649
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "remained a true friend of dog.*"
msgstr "은(는) 개의 진정한 친구로 남았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:650
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "stayed berserk!*"
msgstr "은(는) 계속 광폭했다!*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:651
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "lived a long life of robbing and stealing.*"
msgstr "은(는) 털고 훔치며 오래 살았다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:652
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued anime studies.*"
msgstr "은(는) 애니 연구를 계속했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:653
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "wined and dined in Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서 잘 먹고 잘 마셨다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:662
#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:668
#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:674
#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:693
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "kept fit in EHIS retirement.*"
msgstr "은(는) 은퇴 후에도 EHIS 몸매를 유지했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:681
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "became faster than Sonic.*"
msgstr "은(는) 소닉보다 빨라졌다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:687
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "continued being swole in Canada.*"
msgstr "은(는) 캐나다에서도 계속 우람했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df:700
msgctxt "deathforth/events/finale/epilogue-check.df"
msgid "began a new life in Canada, with less zombies.*"
msgstr "은(는) 좀비가 적은 캐나다에서 새 삶을 시작했다.*"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:143
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid "Factory Complex"
msgstr "공장 단지"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:145
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid ""
" gets overwhelmed by a horde, and flees for a nearby factory. There must be "
"another way out inside."
msgstr "은(는) 좀비 떼에 밀려 근처 공장으로 도망친다. 안에 다른 출구가 있을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:149
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid "DIVE IN"
msgstr "뛰어든다"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:154
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid "Successful Factory"
msgstr "잘나가던 공장"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:156
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid ""
" sees a large factory that looked like it was busy, before the apocalypse. "
"It's less run down than most other factories, at least on the outside."
msgstr "은(는) 종말 전엔 바빴던 것 같은 큰 공장을 본다. 적어도 겉으로는 다른 공장들보다 덜 낡았다."

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:159
#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:181
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid "Explore Factory"
msgstr "공장을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid "Factory Rescue"
msgstr "공장 구출"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid ""
" is driving through a quiet factory district. They run into a horde "
"distracted with chasing someone down."
msgstr "은(는) 조용한 공장 지대를 달리고 있다. 누군가를 쫓느라 정신이 팔린 좀비 떼와 마주친다."

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid "Attempt Rescue!"
msgstr "구출을 시도한다!"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:176
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid "Quiet Factory"
msgstr "조용한 공장"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/indust.df"
msgid ""
" finds a run down factory, like most factories one would see nowadays. "
"Sometimes people try to set up a safe hideout in a factory side closet, but "
"this usually doesn't end well."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 요즘 흔히 보는 공장들처럼 낡은 공장을 발견한다. 가끔 사람들이 공장 옆 창고에 안전한 은신처를 차리려 하지만, 대개 끝이 좋지"
" 않다."

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "The Way Out"
msgstr "탈출구"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "You've found the ladder out of here!"
msgstr "여기서 나가는 사다리를 찾았다!"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "Climb out!"
msgstr "올라간다!"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:13
#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "Stay for Now"
msgstr "일단 남는다"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "The Way Out of the Tutorial"
msgstr "튜토리얼 탈출구"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid ""
"You've found the ladder out of here!\r\n"
"\tThis will end the story for "
msgstr ""
"여기서 나가는 사다리를 찾았다!\r\n"
"\t이걸로 이야기가 끝난다. 끝나는 건 "

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:24
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid ""
", but your story is about to begin!\r\n"
"\tYou will make your way to Canada, looting all the supplies you can on the way. You'll need to build up your skills and your team to survive!"
msgstr ""
"의 이야기지만, 너의 이야기는 이제 막 시작이다!\r\n"
"\t캐나다를 향해 나아가며 가는 길에 물자를 최대한 챙겨라. 살아남으려면 기술과 일행을 키워야 한다!"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:27
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "End Tutorial!"
msgstr "튜토리얼 끝!"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:94
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "River of Death"
msgstr "죽음의 강"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid " arrives in a huge city, conquered by undead, and sees that "
msgstr "은(는) 언데드에게 점령당한 거대 도시에 도착해 깨닫는다. "

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:96
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid ""
" only chance is braving the sewer system.\r\n"
"\tWhen opening the manhole, a cacaphony of groans spill out. This is not a good sign."
msgstr ""
" 유일한 기회는 하수도를 뚫고 가는 것뿐이라는 걸.\r\n"
"\t맨홀을 열자 신음 소리가 한꺼번에 쏟아져 나온다. 좋은 징조가 아니다."

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:101
#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:112
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "DIVE IN"
msgstr "뛰어든다"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "River of Sludge"
msgstr "오물의 강"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid ""
"This city is covered with hordes of undead and wreckage that has been "
"touched by a previous fire. "
msgstr "이 도시는 언데드 무리와 예전 화재에 그을린 잔해로 뒤덮여 있다. "

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid " gets surrounded, and "
msgstr "은(는) 포위당하고, "

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid " only chance is "
msgstr " 유일한 기회는 "

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "SPRINTING THROUGH"
msgstr "전력 질주"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid " the sewers."
msgstr "(으)로 하수도를 통과하는 것뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "Smelly Rescue"
msgstr "냄새나는 구출"

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid ""
" spots a desperate survivor flee from a horde by jumping into the sewer. "
"Helping would involve having to find a safer way out."
msgstr "은(는) 필사적인 생존자가 좀비 떼를 피해 하수도로 뛰어드는 걸 본다. 도우려면 더 안전한 출구를 찾아야 한다."

#: deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df:123
msgctxt "deathforth/events/industrial/sewer.df"
msgid "Attempt rescue!"
msgstr "구출을 시도한다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid ""
" starts taking the arcade machine apart to see how it runs.\r\n"
"\tAfter some quick rooting around, "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 오락기가 어떻게 돌아가는지 보려고 분해하기 시작한다.\r\n"
"\t잠깐 뒤져 보니, "

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid ""
" figures out the reason.\r\n"
"\tIt turns out all these old arcade machines are gas powered! "
msgstr ""
"는 이유를 알아낸다.\r\n"
"\t알고 보니 이 옛날 오락기들은 전부 기름으로 돌아간다! "

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " carefully drains the gas out of its compartment."
msgstr "은(는) 칸에서 기름을 조심스럽게 빼낸다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "DEATH ROAD TO CANADA"
msgstr "데스 로드 투 캐나다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "DEATH SPLATTERS"
msgstr "데스 스플래터"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:15
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "TOUCH OF DEATH"
msgstr "죽음의 손길"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "POLYBIUS"
msgstr "폴리비우스"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:17
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "DEATHSPLOSIONAL"
msgstr "데스플로전"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:18
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "U*L*T*R*A*D*E*A*T*H"
msgstr "U*L*T*R*A*D*E*A*T*H"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " plays an old arcade game named "
msgstr "은(는) 옛날 오락 게임을 한다. 제목은 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid ""
" and really gets into it.\r\n"
"\tLike all video games ever made, playing it increases your skills with guns. The critics were right.\r\n"
"\tBefore "
msgstr ""
". 그리고 완전히 빠져든다.\r\n"
"\t역대 모든 비디오 게임이 그렇듯, 이 게임을 하면 총 실력이 는다. 비평가들 말이 맞았다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " knew it, 2 hours had passed."
msgstr "이(가) 정신 차려 보니 2시간이 지나 있었다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "There was no one around to defend "
msgstr "곁에서 지켜 줄 사람이 없었다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " during this, so "
msgstr "은(는) 이 와중에 혼자였고, 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:30
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " had to fend off zombies while playing. Watch out!"
msgstr "는 게임하면서 좀비를 막아야 했다. 조심해!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "Arcade Break"
msgstr "오락 휴식"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid ""
"This arcade machine seems to be working! It's not very clear how it can run "
"without electricity."
msgstr "이 오락기는 작동하는 것 같다! 전기도 없이 어떻게 돌아가는지는 잘 모르겠다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid ""
" stares at the arcade machine in confusion. What seperates people from "
"animals is mostly that animals don't play video games. At least, for the "
"most part."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 혼란스러운 눈으로 오락기를 쳐다본다. 사람과 동물을 가르는 건 대체로 동물은 비디오 게임을 안 한다는 점이다. 적어도 대부분은."

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:43
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid ""
"With no one trustworthy nearby to watch out for zombies, playing it could be"
" dangerous."
msgstr "좀비를 감시해 줄 믿을 만한 사람이 근처에 없어서, 게임을 하면 위험할 수 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " considers taking a videogame break while "
msgstr "은(는) 잠깐 게임하며 쉴까 고민한다. 지켜 주는 동료가 있으니 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:45
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " is guarded."
msgstr "도 안전하다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " plays the arcade game"
msgstr "이(가) 오락을 한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:49
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid " dismantles the arcade machine"
msgstr "이(가) 오락기를 분해한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df:51
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/arcadeloc.df"
msgid "Leave it for now"
msgstr "일단 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid " uses all "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:7
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid ""
" mechanical skills to figure out what the many, many buttons on the coffee brewer do.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 기계 실력을 총동원해 커피 머신의 수많은, 정말 수많은 버튼이 뭘 하는지 알아낸다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:8
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid ""
" makes the perfect cup of coffee! It's delicious!\r\n"
"\tThe coffee machine sparks, emits smoke, and dies."
msgstr ""
"는 완벽한 커피 한 잔을 내린다! 맛있다!\r\n"
"\t커피 머신은 불꽃을 튀기고, 연기를 뿜더니, 죽는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid ""
" is feeling too sick to enjoy coffee that's been sitting in a machine for "
"what might be years."
msgstr "은(는) 몸이 너무 안 좋아서 어쩌면 몇 년째 기계 안에 있었을지 모를 커피를 즐길 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:19
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid ""
" drinks EVEN MORE coffee and then feels pretty sick afterwards. \r\n"
"\t\tIt's hard to say if it was the massive amount of caffeine, the filthy cups, or how the coffee has been rotting for an unknown amount of time."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 커피를 더 마시고 나서 속이 꽤 안 좋아진다. \r\n"
"\t\t엄청난 카페인 때문인지, 더러운 컵 때문인지, 언제부터 썩고 있었는지 모를 커피 때문인지 알 수 없다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid ""
" sprays some coffee into an old cup lying around and then drinks it.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 굴러다니던 낡은 컵에 커피를 받아 마신다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid " feels all COFFEE'D UP."
msgstr "는 완전 카페인 충전 완료다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:29
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid "Apocalyptic Coffee"
msgstr "종말의 커피"

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid ""
"This enormous and complex coffee machine was built to survive a few different kinds of end of the world scenarios. This was a big part of this coffee shop's marketing campaign.\r\n"
"\tTruth in advertising, it still works!"
msgstr ""
"이 거대하고 복잡한 커피 머신은 여러 종류의 종말 시나리오에서도 살아남도록 만들어졌다. 이게 이 커피숍 마케팅의 핵심이었다.\r\n"
"\t과장 광고가 아니었다. 아직 작동한다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid ""
" doesn't have the first idea as to how to operate this thing. And really, "
msgstr "은(는) 이걸 어떻게 작동시키는지 전혀 모른다. 그리고 사실, "

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:34
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid "s shouldn't drink coffee anyway."
msgstr "은(는) 원래 커피를 마시면 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid " gets some COFFEE"
msgstr "이(가) 커피를 마신다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:38
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid " messes with the settings"
msgstr "이(가) 설정을 만진다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df:40
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/coffeeloc.df"
msgid "Leave it alone"
msgstr "그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:9
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Swarmed Apartment"
msgstr "좀비 떼 아파트"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" finds a town that's eerily quiet. At the edge of the smaller buildings, "
"there's an apartment building that looks like it hasn't been looted yet."
msgstr "은(는) 섬뜩할 만큼 조용한 마을을 발견한다. 작은 건물들 끝자락에, 아직 털리지 않은 것 같은 아파트 건물이 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:14
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Visit Apartment Building"
msgstr "아파트 건물에 간다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:20
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Big House on the Hill"
msgstr "언덕 위의 큰 집"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:22
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" drives to a town that's been burnt to the ground. There is a large house "
"looming on a nearby hill. Even from far away, it looks completely swarmed "
"with zombies."
msgstr "은(는) 잿더미가 된 마을에 도착한다. 근처 언덕 위에 큰 집이 우뚝 서 있다. 멀리서 봐도 좀비로 완전히 뒤덮인 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:25
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Visit House"
msgstr "집에 간다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Bullet-Ridden House"
msgstr "총알 자국투성이 집"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees a house from a distance. On getting closer, it looks like a large "
"gunfight happened here between humans. From the house, many groans of the "
"undead can be heard. "
msgstr ""
"은(는) 멀리서 집 한 채를 본다. 가까이 가 보니, 사람들끼리 큰 총격전이 벌어졌던 것 같다. 집 안에서 언데드의 신음 소리가 잔뜩 "
"들린다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:36
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore the House"
msgstr "집을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:42
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "House on the Road"
msgstr "길가의 집"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:44
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" spots a house on the road. It looks fairly quiet from the outside, but "
"looking through the windows reveals shapes lurching around in the dark."
msgstr "은(는) 길가의 집을 발견한다. 밖에서 보기엔 꽤 조용하지만, 창문으로 들여다보면 어둠 속에서 비틀거리는 형체들이 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:47
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Enter House"
msgstr "집에 들어간다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:52
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Busy Hotel"
msgstr "붐비는 호텔"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:54
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" spots a hotel while travelling through a ransacked town. It looks like a "
"group of people tried to barricade it, but were interrupted. All that's left"
" are the undead."
msgstr "은(는) 약탈당한 마을을 지나다 호텔을 발견한다. 누군가 바리케이드를 치려다 중단된 것 같다. 남은 건 언데드뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:57
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Enter Hotel"
msgstr "호텔에 들어간다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:62
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Hotel in Quiet Town"
msgstr "조용한 마을의 호텔"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:64
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" goes through an empty town, with no supplies to be found and little zombie "
"activity. One small hotel seems to have more undead roaming through it than "
"the rest."
msgstr "은(는) 물자도 없고 좀비도 별로 없는 텅 빈 마을을 지난다. 작은 호텔 하나에만 유독 언데드가 많이 돌아다니는 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:67
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Hotel"
msgstr "호텔을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:73
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Police Headquarters"
msgstr "경찰 본부"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:75
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" spots a local police department headquarters. The undead around it already "
"seem pretty riled up, but there may be some good things in there."
msgstr "은(는) 지역 경찰 본부를 발견한다. 주변 언데드는 이미 꽤 흥분한 것 같지만, 안에 좋은 게 있을지도."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:78
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Police HQ"
msgstr "경찰 본부를 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:84
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Hospital Raid"
msgstr "병원 습격"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:86
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees a hospital. Medical supplies can often still be found in places like "
"this, due to the large amount of undead still wandering around."
msgstr "은(는) 병원을 본다. 이런 곳엔 아직도 언데드가 잔뜩 돌아다니는 탓에 의약품이 남아 있는 경우가 많다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Hospital"
msgstr "병원을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Big Office Complex"
msgstr "대형 오피스 단지"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees a large office building. The amount of zombies in it hints that people"
" were still going to work like normal, even after the outbreak."
msgstr "은(는) 큰 사무실 건물을 본다. 안의 좀비 수를 보면, 사태가 터진 뒤에도 사람들이 평소처럼 출근했던 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:100
#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:111
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Office"
msgstr "사무실을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Fancy Office"
msgstr "고급 사무실"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees an office building that looks expensive from the outside. There must "
"be something in there worth taking."
msgstr "은(는) 겉보기에 비싸 보이는 사무실 건물을 본다. 안에 챙길 만한 게 있을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:117
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Fancy House"
msgstr "고급 주택"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" spies a house that looks expensive from the outside. There must be "
"something in there worth checking out."
msgstr "은(는) 겉보기에 비싸 보이는 집을 발견한다. 안에 살펴볼 만한 게 있을 거다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:122
#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:133
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore House"
msgstr "집을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:128
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Riled Up House"
msgstr "성난 좀비의 집"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid " drives up to a house and sees that the zombies were angry before "
msgstr "은(는) 어느 집 앞에 차를 세운다. 좀비들은 이미 화가 나 있었다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:130
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid " got there. There are no signs of life, except unlife."
msgstr "이(가) 도착하기도 전부터. 살아 있는 흔적은 없다. 죽지 않은 것들 빼고."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:139
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Riled Up Apartment"
msgstr "성난 좀비의 아파트"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:141
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" spots an apartment with agitated zombies shambling nearby. They may be "
"angry for no reason, as there's no signs of anyone else there."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 근처에서 흥분한 좀비들이 비틀거리는 아파트를 발견한다. 아무도 없는 걸 보면 그냥 이유 없이 화가 난 걸지도 모른다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:144
#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:177
#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:210
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Apartments"
msgstr "아파트를 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:150
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "House Rescue"
msgstr "주택 구출"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:152
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees an agitated horde of zombies chasing someone. They flee into a nearby "
"house."
msgstr "은(는) 흥분한 좀비 떼가 누군가를 쫓는 걸 본다. 그 사람은 근처 집으로 도망친다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:155
#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:166
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Rescue them!"
msgstr "구해 주자!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:161
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Apartment Rescue"
msgstr "아파트 구출"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "From a distance, "
msgstr "멀리서, "

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" spots someone fleeing from an angry horde. They disappear into an apartment"
" building."
msgstr "은(는) 성난 좀비 떼에게서 도망치는 사람을 발견한다. 그 사람은 아파트 건물 안으로 사라진다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Big Apartment"
msgstr "큰 아파트"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:174
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" drives near a rather large apartment building. It may take awhile to "
"explore this, but they might have an indoor pool!"
msgstr "은(는) 꽤 큰 아파트 건물 근처를 지난다. 다 둘러보려면 시간이 좀 걸리겠지만, 실내 수영장이 있을지도!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:183
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Dead Arcade"
msgstr "죽은 오락실"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:185
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" finds a pretty big arcade, full of now silent video games. Maybe if you "
"check, one of them will be gas or battery powered. That could happen."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 이제는 조용해진 게임기로 가득한 꽤 큰 오락실을 발견한다. 잘 찾아보면 기름이나 배터리로 돌아가는 게 하나쯤 있을지도. 그럴 "
"수도 있지."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:188
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Arcade"
msgstr "오락실을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Small Suburb"
msgstr "작은 교외"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:196
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" drives through a ruined suburb. There's a few buildings that look like they"
" haven't been completely trashed."
msgstr "은(는) 폐허가 된 교외를 지난다. 완전히 망가지지 않은 듯한 건물이 몇 채 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:199
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Suburb"
msgstr "교외를 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Abandoned Apartments"
msgstr "버려진 아파트"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" drives through a city. A few apartment buildings stand out as being "
"slightly less ruined than the surroundings."
msgstr "은(는) 도시를 지난다. 아파트 건물 몇 채가 주변보다 조금 덜 망가져 눈에 띈다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:216
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Commercial Row"
msgstr "상가 거리"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:218
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" drives near a city's commercial district. A short distance away, some shops"
" are visible that seem worth checking out."
msgstr "은(는) 도시 상업 지구 근처를 지난다. 조금 떨어진 곳에 살펴볼 만한 가게들이 보인다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Shops"
msgstr "가게를 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Free Car!"
msgstr "공짜 차!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:229
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" drives through a city. A car is parked on the streets, and it looks almost "
"pristine. It's just waiting to be taken!"
msgstr "은(는) 도시를 지난다. 거리에 거의 새것 같은 차가 서 있다. 가져가 달라고 기다리는 것 같다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Check out car"
msgstr "차를 살펴본다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:237
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Popular Arcade"
msgstr "인기 오락실"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:238
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" spots an arcade. The dead completely swarm the inside of it. It's probably "
"a bad idea to go in there. Or is it? At least bring someone to watch your "
"back."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 오락실을 발견한다. 안이 시체들로 완전히 들끓는다. 들어가는 건 아마 나쁜 생각일 거다. 아닐 수도? 적어도 뒤를 봐줄 사람은 "
"데려가라."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:241
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Video games!"
msgstr "비디오 게임!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:246
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Gym Obsession"
msgstr "헬스 중독"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees a gym with a massive amount of undead in it. It's a bad idea to go in "
"here, but then again you don't want to mess up your workout schedule. You'll"
" need a spotter for this."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 언데드가 엄청나게 많은 체육관을 본다. 들어가는 건 나쁜 생각이지만, 운동 스케줄을 망칠 순 없다. 보조해 줄 사람이 필요하다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Work out!"
msgstr "운동하자!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Shopping Mall"
msgstr "쇼핑몰"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees a mall. These places are death traps, but there's at least couple of "
"stores inside that haven't been ransacked."
msgstr "은(는) 쇼핑몰을 본다. 이런 곳은 죽음의 함정이지만, 안에 털리지 않은 가게가 적어도 두어 개는 있다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:259
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Shop till you drop"
msgstr "쓰러질 때까지 쇼핑"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:264
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Shopping Emergency"
msgstr "쇼핑 비상사태"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:265
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" sees another survivor flee from a big horde. They run right into a shopping"
" mall. This is a terrible idea. Trying to save them would be a terrible "
"idea."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 다른 생존자가 큰 좀비 떼를 피해 도망치는 걸 본다. 그 사람은 곧장 쇼핑몰로 뛰어든다. 끔찍한 생각이다. 그 사람을 구하려는 "
"것도 끔찍한 생각이다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:268
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Try to save them!"
msgstr "구해 보자!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:273
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "House in Flames!"
msgstr "불타는 집!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" is surprised as a house down the road mysteriously catches on fire. "
"Curiousity overwhelms "
msgstr "은(는) 길 아래쪽 집에 수상하게 불이 붙자 깜짝 놀란다. 호기심이 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:274
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" basic survival instincts.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
" 기본적인 생존 본능을 이겨 버린다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:275
#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "WARNING:"
msgstr "경고:"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:275
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid " CONTENTS MAY BE HOT!"
msgstr " 내용물이 뜨거울 수 있음!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:278
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Investigate fire"
msgstr "불을 조사한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:283
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Dark Mansion"
msgstr "어두운 저택"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid ""
" runs into an enormous mansion. There can be a lot of loot in here, and a lot of zombiefied looters wandering around in the dark.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 거대한 저택에 다다른다. 물자도 많겠지만, 어둠 속을 떠도는 좀비가 된 약탈자들도 많을 거다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:285
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid " FLASHLIGHT RECOMMENDED!"
msgstr " 손전등 지참 권장!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df:289
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/cyoa-k-inners.df"
msgid "Explore Mansion"
msgstr "저택을 탐색한다"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:4
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "Ew gross"
msgstr "으 더러워"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:5
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"This gym equipment is all covered in sweat now!\r\n"
"\tNo way is "
msgstr ""
"운동 기구가 이제 전부 땀범벅이다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:6
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " touching it."
msgstr "은(는) 절대 이걸 안 만진다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:11
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " dies from this weightlifting mishap."
msgstr "은(는) 이 역도 사고로 죽는다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:13
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "An hour passed during that impromptu workout session."
msgstr "즉흥 운동을 하는 사이 한 시간이 지났다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:16 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "There was no one around to defend "
msgstr "곁에서 지켜 줄 사람이 없었다. "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:16 deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:79
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " during the workout, so "
msgstr "은(는) 운동하는 동안 혼자였고, 그래서 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:16
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " had to fend off zombies between reps. Watch out!"
msgstr "는 세트 사이사이 좀비를 막아야 했다. 조심해!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " takes off most of the weight from the barbell and then starts "
msgstr "은(는) 바벨에서 무게를 거의 다 빼고 시작한다: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "PUMPING IRON"
msgstr "쇠질"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:21
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " with the mostly empty bar."
msgstr ". 거의 빈 봉으로."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "It's still a great workout for "
msgstr "그래도 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:23
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ". And nothing is broken or ruptured in the process!"
msgstr "에게는 훌륭한 운동이다. 그리고 그 과정에서 부러지거나 터진 데도 없다!"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:26
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid ""
"It just wasn't enough weight to really do anything. The zombies weren't "
"impressed, either."
msgstr "무게가 너무 가벼워서 별 효과가 없었다. 좀비들도 감명받지 않았다."

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " takes off some weight from the barbell, but not so much that "
msgstr "은(는) 바벨에서 무게를 좀 빼지만, 너무 많이 빼진 않는다. 그래야 "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid " can't "
msgstr "가 이걸 할 수 있으니까: "

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:31
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "GET SUPER PUMPED"
msgstr "제대로 펌핑하기"

#: deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df:33
msgctxt "deathforth/events/inner/gymloc.df"
msgid "That was too much weight! "
msgstr "너무 무거웠다! "
